F9d74e10a-be54-43ef-85e1-1cc59929eaae_2920x920.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>Talent Moves</h4><p>Lots of interesting moves lately in tech / AI. Here&#8217;s a quick list:</p><ul><li><p>Today is <a href="https://x.com/tim_cook">Tim Cook</a>&#8217;s last day as the CEO of Apple (!) after a historic 15-year tenure. He&#8217;s being succeeded by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/john-ternus-2392b76/">John Ternus</a>, Senior VP of Hardware Engineering who&#8217;s been at Apple for 25 years and previously led the engineering teams behind the iPhone, iPad, and Mac - and the transition to Apple Silicon.</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mikemyer/">Mike Myer</a> has joined Sierra&#8217;s GTM team after 8+ years at Snowflake, helping enterprises move AI agents from pilots into production</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rosekuan/">Rose Kuan</a> has joined OpenAI as Member of Design Staff after 4 years at Coinbase/Base, making the jump from crypto into frontier AI</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/emmiecampbell/">Emily Campbell</a> has joined Figma as Director of Design for AI Models, focused on how model behavior, intent, semantics, and context can augment the design process</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/derek-mulvey-b6a8533b/">Derek Mulvey</a> will become Rivian&#8217;s Interim CFO at the end of October, stepping up from his current role as VP of Finance</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vladimirov-al/">Sasha Vladimirov</a> has joined Snowflake to lead the Dynamic Tables team in Berlin after spending the last several years building an AI startup</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/estherfang/">Esther Fang</a> has left Google after 11.5 years and is now building something new in Singapore; she says hiring will begin soon</p></li></ul><p><em><a href="https://forms.gle/DZSznJjdhwy8t99cA">Submit a talent move here</a><span> to be featured in the next newsletter.</span></em></p><div><hr></div><h4>Build -1 &#8594; 0</h4><p><em>Get on the ground floor with the founding team of a pre-seed or seed-stage startup.</em></p><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hanniazia/">Hannia Zia</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joanaferreira0011/">Joana Ferreira</a> raised a $3.5M seed led by a16z speedrun for <a href="https://usecascade.ai/">Cascade</a>, which predicts where major construction projects will happen before they go to bid. They&#8217;re hiring a <a href="https://speedrun-talent-network.com/jobs/founding-engineer-cascade-13a91cb6">Founding Engineer</a> in NYC for up to $250K to work in person next to the founders. <a href="https://speedrun-talent-network.com/jobs/founding-engineer-cascade-13a91cb6">Apply here</a>!</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/blakeandersonw/">Blake Anderson</a> is hiring a CTO for up to $300K at <a href="https://www.10x.so/">10X</a>, his SoHo-based app studio. He's looking for someone exceptional with agent harnesses and consumer software. <a href="https://www.10x.so/careers/founding-engineer">Apply here!</a></p></li></ul><div class="twitter-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/blakeandersonw/status/2093093103356068204?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Hiring a CTO for 10x.\n\nWe are at over $6m ARR growing 30% month over month.\n\n150-300k cash + 1-10% equity.\n\nMust be exceptional with agent harnesses &amp;amp; consumer software.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;blakeandersonw&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Blake Anderson&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1973883240776937476/uZNUKr-K_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-27T21:47:38.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:23,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:10,&quot;like_count&quot;:426,&quot;impression_count&quot;:37612,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}" data-component-name="Twitter2ToDOM"></div><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/neel-popat-7a6b233b/">Neel Popat</a> is building <a href="https://popcorn.space/">Popcorn</a>, a next-gen telco with a single global phone plan and no roaming fees, plus an AI layer that screens calls, takes notes and books restaurants. He's looking for a motion designer - the brief is to make people replay the in-app tutorials 100 times. <a href="https://x.com/theneelpopat/status/2093361538627174546">DM him</a> if this sounds like you!</p></li></ul><div class="twitter-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/theneelpopat/status/2093361538627174546?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;We need a motion designer.\n\nThe brief: make people replay our in-app tutorials 100 times.\n\nSend me the killers.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;theneelpopat&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Neel Popat&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2054283101409333249/9nh-TdLA_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-28T15:34:18.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:51,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1,&quot;like_count&quot;:45,&quot;impression_count&quot;:1883,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}" data-component-name="Twitter2ToDOM"></div><p><em><span>If you&#8217;re building something new and want to be featured in the next newsletter, </span><a href="https://forms.gle/Ez7LwGM4y3rH2c7N9">fill out this form</a><span>.</span></em></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://a16zjobs.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary button-wrapper" href="https://a16zjobs.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><hr></div><h4>Build 0 &#8594; 1</h4><p><em>Accelerate the growth of a Series A, B, or C startup with early momentum.</em></p><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.arcboats.com/">Arc</a> is hiring a <a href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/arcboatcompany/jobs/5408106008">Staff Technical Program Manager</a> for $175K, onsite at their LA headquarters. You'll own commercial programs from contract award through vessel delivery - starting with a $160M contract for a fleet of electric tugboats - running the shipyard relationships and standing up the program management function Arc's commercial business will scale on. <a href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/arcboatcompany/jobs/5408106008">Apply here</a>!</p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/domgor/">Dominique Gordon</a> is making the first operations hire at <a href="https://paper.design/">Paper</a>, the design canvas for teams shipping with agents. You&#8217;d build the business layer from scratch: the data and dashboards the team runs on, the GTM systems, and financial and people ops, on a team of 12. <a href="https://paper.design/blog/operations">Apply here</a>!</p></li><li><p><a href="https://slite.com/">Slite</a> is hiring a <a href="https://slite.com/jobs/head-of-growth-marketing">Head of Growth Marketing</a>, remote across Europe and North America. They're a 20-person team building an AI knowledge base, fully remote since 2017. You'd own marketing end to end with qualified pipeline as your north star, and work closely with the CEO and CTO. <a href="https://slite.com/jobs/head-of-growth-marketing">Apply here</a>!</p></li></ul><p><em><span>If you&#8217;re hiring and want to be featured in the next newsletter, </span><a href="https://forms.gle/Ez7LwGM4y3rH2c7N9">fill out this form</a><span>.</span></em></p><div><hr></div><h4>Build 1 &#8594; beyond</h4><p><em>Join a growth-stage startup scaling to its next horizon.</em></p><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.figma.com/">Figma</a> is hiring a <a href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/figma/jobs/6135395004?gh_jid=6135395004">Design Program Manager, Context Platform</a> for up to $303K in SF, NYC, or remote in the US. It&#8217;s a 0 &#8594; 1 job inside a public company where you&#8217;ll build the operating model for a brand-new pillar - the design systems, content, and design-to-code relationships that feed context to AI agents - as the right hand partner to the Senior Design Director. <a href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/figma/jobs/6135395004?gh_jid=6135395004">Apply here</a>!</p></li></ul><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KvgT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg" width="428" height="419.975" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1e58c0ae-ff64-471d-abaf-c8d2b03c09a9_1440x1413.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1413,&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:428,&quot;bytes&quot;:414888,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;t